  Id: 91
  DisplayName: Locus Mine
  Description: "Converts the attack into a mine that can be detonated for a powerful effect. Requires placement/detonation and delays damage. Supported Attack Skills cannot be used with Melee Weapons Supported Skills always fire at least 1 Projectile Supported Skills throw up to # additional Mines Supported Skills fire #% less Projectiles Supported Skills gain a Base Reservation equal to Base Mana and Life Cost Mine lasts # seconds Mines from Supported Skills can't be Detonated while within # metres of you Mines using Supported Skills always target your location Supported Skills throw Mines in an Arc Supported Skills have a Base Mine Detonation Time of # seconds"
